VED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm which is located 2 5cm from the cavity  The calcified area comes to 3 5cm from the posterior margin and 3 0cm from the skin  Along the posterior aspect there is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm area of retraction which is located 4 0cm from the cavity  The cut surface is tan white  fibrotic and focally calcified  No lymph nodes are identified  Representative sections are submitted as in cassettes A F  A  Cavity to closest deep posterior margin  B  Cavity to skin and scar  C D  Representative sections of cavity wall  E  Area of retraction on posterior aspect and intraparenchymal area of calcification  F  Uninvolved parenchyma  Gross Description by  JENNIFER NASH Resident  RESIDENT FREE SERVICE  MJF                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   BREAST LEFT  SIMPLE MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
