taining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  31 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 13 50 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name and unit number  and accompanied by a radiograph are three parts  Labeled  A  true lateral  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm piece of fatty tissue  It is inked and sectioned to reveal a white firm area  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm within 0 2cm of the final true lateral margins  True lateral margin is submitted in cassettes A and B  the remainder is in C through E  Labeled  B  true deep  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm piece of fatty tissue  It is inked and sectioned to reveal a white and firm area  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm which is 0 1cm from true deep margin  The deep margin is submitted in F and G  and the remainder is in H through J  Labeled  Superficial  is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 5cm of fibroadipose tissue  It is inked and sectioned to reveal REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 7cm white firm area  and grossly abutting the deep margin  A representative section is frozen as frozen section  1  and resubmitted in K  The true superficial margin is submitted as L  The lateral margin is submitted as M  The remainder is submitted entirely in cassettes N through S  Resident  HENRY DONG  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DX  1   TRUE LATERAL   NO GROSS LESIONS IDENTIFIED  AWAIT PERMANENTS  GROSS DX  2   TRUE DEEP   NO GROSS LESIONS IDENTIFIED  AWAIT PERM