d margin  A representative section is frozen as Frozen Section  1 and saved frozen  Tissue is taken for biochemical ER and BRDU studies  The remainder of the mass is submitted entirely in A through D  The remainder of the tissue is submitted in E through G  Resident  George O  Kucyj  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1 BREAST LEFT   BIOPSY  INFILTRATING AND IN SITU CARCINOMA MOST CONSISTENT WITH LOBULAR TYPE  O R  Resident  Anthony Mattia  M D  O R  Diagnosis by  Nancy Lee Harris  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Charles Mason Ferguson  M D  PART   LEFT BREAST   report_end  , Unchecked.
