r portion of wrinkled white skin  which has a REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm retracted nipple  The specimen is oriented with a stitch at 12 o clock  The specimen is inked as follows  Posterior   black  anterior   blue  There is a 3 5cm linear  well healed scar at the medial aspect of the skin  Sectioning reveals a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm cavity within the lower inner quadrant  which extends to within 1 5cm of the posterior margin  The cavity is surrounding by dense gray white fibrous tissue and focal areas of fat necrosis  The cavity is located subjacent to the previously described scar on the skin surface and extends to within 3 0cm of the anterior margin  The remainder of the cut surface consists of lobulated tan yellow fat with a moderate amount of interspersed dense gray white fibrous tissue  No other masses or lesions are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION CODE   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of cavity to posterior margin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of cavity to anterior margin and skin   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of areas of fat necrosis adjacent to the cavity   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID   Representative sections of fibrous tissue away from the cavity  Received fresh  labeled  left breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 8 0cm left breast simple mastectomy specimen  which is partially surfaced by a REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm irregular portion of wrinkled white areolar skin  which has a centrally located 1 5cm grossly unremarkable nipple  The specimen is oriented with a stitch at 6 o clock  The specimen is inked as follows  Posterior   black  anterior   blue  Sectioning reveals a homogenous tan yellow  lobulated cut surface with an abundant amount of interspersed dense gray white fibrous tissue with focal cystic areas  consistent with fibrocystic change  No discrete masses or lesions are grossly identified  Representative sections are submitted as follows  SECTION C