tic with no discrete lesions or other gross abnormalities  Sectioning of the lateral tissue reveals no apparent lymph nodes  and representative sections are submitted as follows  A D  Hemorrhagic cavity with deep margin as A C  E  Representative fibrous tissue  medial to cavity  F  Representative fibrous tissue  lateral to cavity  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast   is a 320 gram  REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 9cm right mastectomy specimen with an attached REMOVED_DATE x 3 5cm tan pink skin ellipse  There is a central REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm unremarkable nipple  and no scar is grossly appreciated  A black stitch designates the 12 o clock aspect as per requisition  The resection margin is inked black  and the specimen is serially sectioned to reveal a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 3cm ill defined tan irregular area  1 5cm of the deep margin  A representative section of this area to the deep margin  Representative section of this area to the deep margin is submitted for frozen section as FX 2  now as G  The remaining shows unremarkable fibrofatty breast tissue  The fibrous tissue surrounding the ill defined areas is submitted as H  Representative sections of the fibrous tissue lateral to this area is submitted as I  and representative fibrous tissue medial to this areas is submitted as J  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  left axillary sentinel lymph node   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm tan  fatty lymph node  which is bisected and entirely submitted for frozen as FX 1  now as K  Gross Description by  STEPHANIE KUEHN Resident  PAULA ARNELL  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  LYMPH NODE  LEFT SENTINEL   THERE IS NO EVIDENCE OF MALIGNANCY  FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  2  RIGHT BREAST  TAN AREA  DEEP   SMALL FOCUS OF APOCRINE METAPLASIA  NO CARCINOMA IS SEEN  O R 